  "notes": "Dark control-room board for hotel housekeeping/front-desk coordination. Signature element is the floor-by-room grid: each tile's fill/outline/dash style + tiny glyphs encode status (dashed amber = due out, red X = vacant dirty, striped blue = cleaning, green outline = clean, filled green = inspected, purple wrench = out of order) with accessible/assigned/priority overlays; status chips dim non-matching rooms. Selecting a guest highlights fitting rooms on the board ('3 rooms fit Echeverría') and the details panel ranks best rooms by readiness; Assign is disabled with a role note ('front-desk-only') and a 'Hand controls to Kenji' link — role handoff via 'At the controls' radio. Live/pause button freezes the stream ('Hold the picture still'). Activity log uses coloured left rules by department (green housekeeping, blue front desk, amber maintenance). Panels scroll internally; full-screen kiosk feel at 1440×900."
